1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,932
MAN: I was at the mall and saw this beautiful laptop.

2
00:00:02,932 --> 00:00:06,130
I couldn't help but pick it up. Don't you think it's nice?

3
00:00:06,130 --> 00:00:09,160
WOMAN: Yes, it's a very nice laptop, but why did you buy it?

4
00:00:09,160 --> 00:00:12,190
I thought you just picked up a new one a few weeks ago.

5
00:00:12,190 --> 00:00:14,586
MAN: I know, but I was not happy with the keyboard,

6
00:00:14,586 --> 00:00:18,290
so I gave it to my brother, and he gave me the money to buy this one.

7
00:00:18,290 --> 00:00:24,000
WOMAN: You guys must have a lot of money. These laptops cost an arm and a leg.
